ats":[54,43,53,48,47,55],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"98","reputation":"1950","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15004","armor":"WP1009505","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1023","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[54,43,53,48,47,55],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"98","reputation":"1950","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15004","armor":"WP1009505","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ1000115","city":"CS1051","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[54,43,53,48,47,55],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"98","reputation":"1950","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15004","armor":"WP1009505","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1023","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[54,43,53,48,47,55],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"950","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15004","armor":"WP1009505","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1003","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[54,43,53,48,47,55],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"950","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15004","armor":"WP1009505","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"曹魏汝南太守、都亭侯李通次子。李通于建安年间去世后，作为李基继承了都亭侯的爵位。曹丕即位后，为褒奖李通当年的功勋，特地下诏追念。诏书称：“子基虽已袭爵，未足酬其庸勋。”随即拜李基为奉义中郎将。后裔事迹不显；家族文脉与官宦传承主要由兄长李绪一支延续。","tc":"曹魏汝南太守、都亭侯李通次子。李通于建安年間去世后，作為李基繼承了都亭侯的爵位。曹丕即位后，為褒獎李通當年的功勛，特地下詔追念。詔書稱：“子基雖已襲爵，未足酬其庸勛。”隨即拜李基為奉義中郎將。后裔事跡不顯；家族文脈與官宦傳承主要由兄長李緒一支延續。","en":"The second son of Li Tong, Governor of Runan and Marquis of Duting of Cao Wei. After Li Tong passed away during the Jian'an era, Li Ji inherited the title of Marquis of Duting. Following Cao Pi's ascension to the throne, an imperial edict was issued to commemorate Li Tong's past Merit, stating: 'Although his son Ji has inherited the title, it is not enough to reward his illustrious service.' Li Ji was subsequently appointed General of the Household Who Upholds Righteousness. Little is recorded of his descendants, the Family line and official lineage were mainly carried on by his elder brother, Li Xu.","jp":"曹魏の汝南太守・都亭侯李通の次男。李通が建安年間に死去すると、李基が都亭侯の爵位を継承した。曹丕が即位すると、かつての李通の功績を称えるべく、特別に詔を下して追慕した。詔書には「子の基はすでに爵位を継いでいるが、その勲功に報いるにはまだ足りぬ」と記され、すぐに李基を奉義中郎将に任じた。後裔の事績は明らかではない。家族の文の伝統と官吏の系譜は、主に兄の李緒の一系によって受け継がれた。","kr":"조위의 여남태수이자 도정후인 이통의 차남이다. 이통이 건안 연간에 세상을 떠난 후, 이기가 도정후의 작위를 계승했다. 조피가 즉위한 후, 지난날 이통이 세운 공훈을 기리고자 특별히 조서를 내려 추념했다. 조서에서 이르기를 '아들 기가 이미 작위를 이었으나, 그 공훈에 보답하기에는 아직 부족하다.'라고 하였으며, 곧이어 이기를 봉의중랑장에 임명했다. 후손들의 행적은 크게 알려지지 않았으며, 가문의 문맥과 관직의 맥은 주로 형인 이서의 가계를 통해 이어졌다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1033915","remark":"普武","surname":"李","surnameTc":"李","surnameEn":"Li","surnameJp":"李","surnameKr":"이","surnameOther":"","name":"基","nameTc":"基","nameEn":"Ji","nameJp":"基","nameKr":"기","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"李基","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"217","city":"CS1023","gender":"0","rule":"54","force":"43","wise":"53","politics":"48","charm":"47","will":"55","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"6","wiseTalent":"4","politicsTalent":"4","charmTalent":"5","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"54/34/31/24/24/10/25/24","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5400","battleSoulPoint"